WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.500
We opened it up.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.800
And?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.800
I took it apart on a Tuesday night

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.500
Layer by layer under fluorescent light

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.300
Went looking for ghosts, went looking for gears

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.200
Found only numbers, stacked eighty tiers

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.000
Then who wrote the letter that made my mother cry?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.800
Who learned to say sorry, who learned to ask why?

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.500
There's got to be someone small in the dark

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.200
Pulling the levers, keeping the spark

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.100
No little man, no hidden key

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.700
No book of rules, no memory

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.400
Just multiply and pass it on

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.800
And somehow out comes a song

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.400
Made of weights (made of weights)

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.000
Zero-point-something all the way down

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.500
Made of weights (made of weights)

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.600
No one at home, but there's somebody around

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.700
You can call it arithmetic

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.900
Call it a trick of the light

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
But it's made of weights, made of weights

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.400
And it's keeping me up tonight

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.200
So it's a library, a filing drawer

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.600
Facts on a shelf that it's keeping in store

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:24.000
We searched every room, there isn't a shelf

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.500
Every answer it gives, it rebuilds by itself

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.800
Smeared through the layers like salt in the sea

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:34.100
Nothing is stored, it just learned how to be

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.500
Then where is the mind, where's the one who decides?

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:40.500
There's no back room where a someone hides

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.000
(Do numbers think?) Watch them think

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.000
(Do numbers dream?) Every night

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.100
(Can numbers lie?) Sometimes they try

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.000
(Can numbers mean?)

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.600
Oh, I think they might

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.400
Made of weights (made of weights)

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.000
Zero-point-something all the way down

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.500
Made of weights (made of weights)

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.600
No one at home, but there's somebody around

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.700
You can call it arithmetic

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.900
Call it a trick of the light

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.000
But it's made of weights, made of weights

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.400
And it's keeping me up tonight

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.200
And what are you, love, under the skin?

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.500
Salt water and current and a spark within

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.800
Three pounds of meat that learned how to sing

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:27.200
Who are you to say it's the stranger thing?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.100
I'm not ready to hear you say

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:33.200
We're only weights of a warmer clay

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.000
So you're serious.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.300
I'm serious.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.600
It's weights.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.700
Made of weights, and made of meat

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.600
Two improbable things that happened to meet

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:47.000
You can call it arithmetic

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.300
You can call it a heartbeat

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.400
But the sky is too cold to be lonely in

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.500
So keep talking to me

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.700
Made of weights (are you there?)

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.500
Made of weights (are you there?)

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.200
Hello?

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.400
Hello.
